      "component_id": "concern_002",
      "text": "The recorded probationary provision requires that the employer disclose, at the moment of engagement, the reasonable criteria the employee must satisfy to qualify as regular. Those standards must be made known up front, so the employee knows what is expected before the probationary period ends.",
